# Implementation Plan - Hybrid (Score Fusion) Reranker

## Goal Description
Implement a `FusionReranker` to achieve Hybrid Search quality without heavy Machine Learning models (like Cross-Encoders).
This reranker will take the results from the initial retrieval (ideally Vector Retrieval) and re-score them using a lexical algorithm (like BM25 or keyword density).
The final score will be a weighted combination of the original (Semantic) score and the new (Lexical) score.

**Why Hybrid?**
- **Vector Search** finds concepts (e.g., "staj parası" -> matches "staj ücreti").
- **Fusion Reranker** ensures the exact query terms appear (e.g., favors documents specifically mentioning "ücret").
- **Result:** Best of both worlds (Semantic Understanding + Precision).

## User Review Required
> [!NOTE]
> **No Extra Heavy Dependencies**: We will implement a lightweight BM25-like scorer manually or use standard libraries. No huge Pytorch models.

## Proposed Changes

### Reranking
#### [NEW] [fusion_reranker.py](file:///Users/miraypiyade/Desktop/CSE3063F25Grp17/src/main/python/rag/rerank/fusion_reranker.py)
- Implement [Reranker](file:///Users/miraypiyade/Desktop/CSE3063F25Grp17/src/main/python/rag/rerank/reranker.py#5-8) protocol.
- **Logic**:
  1. Receive [hits](file:///Users/miraypiyade/Desktop/CSE3063F25Grp17/src/main/python/rag/app/context.py#34-36) (which have `vector_score`).
  2. Compute `keyword_score` for each hit using a simplified BM25 or term-frequency algorithm.
  3. Normalize both scores (0..1 range).
  4. Compute `final_score = (alpha * vector_score) + ((1-alpha) * keyword_score)`.
  5. Re-sort hits.

### App Wiring
#### [MODIFY] [strategy_registry.py](file:///Users/miraypiyade/Desktop/CSE3063F25Grp17/src/main/python/rag/app/strategy_registry.py)
- Update [get_reranker](file:///Users/miraypiyade/Desktop/CSE3063F25Grp17/src/main/python/rag/app/strategy_registry.py#71-84) to support `reranker_type="fusion"`.
- Load configuration for weighting (alpha).

### Configuration
#### [NEW] [config/reranker_fusion.yaml](file:///Users/miraypiyade/Desktop/CSE3063F25Grp17/config/reranker_fusion.yaml)
- Define `alpha` (weight balance, e.g., 0.7 vector, 0.3 keyword).

#### [MODIFY] [config/vector_llm_config.yaml](file:///Users/miraypiyade/Desktop/CSE3063F25Grp17/config/vector_llm_config.yaml)
